 {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm baking a pie."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le04ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Connectors "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use connectors to join words and phrases.  They are usually found in the middle of a sentence. They connect ideas or sentences together."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"05\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Connector </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Explanation </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"and \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Connects statements or ideas that are similar\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You're kind <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> and</span> helpful.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"but\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Connects statements that express opposite ideas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's very kind of you to ask <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> but</span> it's okay.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"or\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Gives options or choices\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They are not nice <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> or</span> friendly.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"because\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Gives a reason \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She is friendly <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> because</span> she helps us. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking to Borrow Things"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"strong\">can</span> or <span class=\"strong\">could</span> when you ask to borrow things.  <br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " Structure of question:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Can/Could + Subject + borrow + object ? </span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"03\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Modals </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Examples </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I borrow a cup of sugar, please?</span>  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could we borrow your book, please? </span> <br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you lend* me your book tonight?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">*</span>You use <span class=\"italic\">lend</span> to say that you give something to another person. You use <span class=\"italic\">borrow</span> to say that something is taken away from another person."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le04lo05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose 4 people you know."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think of a word to describe each of them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give a reason about why you choose the word. Use the connector <span class=\"italic\">because</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the chart."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Person's Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Reason\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Molly</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">funny</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Molly is funny because she makes me laugh.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe people with two connected ideas."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe people's personalities. "}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le04ob05re2aud01", 